  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">학교 동료 선생님의 아이디어를 받아<br>아이들이랑 원소기호를 외우면서 타이포그래피로 학급 주기율표 만들기를 했습니다~<br><br>읽을 자료를 주고 원소의 특징을 이용하여 타이포그래피로 나타내라고 하니 너무 잘 하더라구요!<br><br>결과물을 벽에 붙여 놓으니깐 다른 친구들 것도 보면서 이야기를 나누더라구요~<br><br>활동 결과 공유합니다!<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81373f4078dc73cd781ef18b6072c876a3c916a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81373f4078dc73cd781ef18b6072c876a3c916a3\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54daf22caa294768e6fc65896e07fc73db4d81a4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54daf22caa294768e6fc65896e07fc73db4d81a4\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/017d4aace81099bc7e67c97404db518141f12148\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/017d4aace81099bc7e67c97404db518141f12148\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
